1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,720
The Black Death. Explain like you are 5.

2
00:00:02,720 --> 00:00:07,680
Step 1. 1347. Ships dock in Sicily. The sailors are dead or dying. Black

3
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:11,680
swellings the size of eggs on their necks and groins bleeding from every opening.

4
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:15,360
The port authorities order the ships back to sea. Too late. Within days, people in

5
00:00:15,360 --> 00:00:19,040
the port town are showing the same symptoms. Within weeks, it is moving north.

6
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:22,480
Nobody knows what it is. Nobody knows how it spreads. Nobody knows how to stop it.

7
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:27,040
Step 2. It moves faster than news of it. It kills in days, sometimes hours, a fever,

8
00:00:27,040 --> 00:00:30,960
then the swellings, then black patches on the skin as blood vessels burst beneath,

9
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:33,840
then death. Entire households wiped out overnight.

10
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:37,280
Priests refuse to give last rites. Doctors refuse to enter sick homes.

11
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:41,760
Bodies pile in the streets faster than they can be buried. Mass graves outside every city.

12
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:45,840
Step 3. People blame the Jews. They blame the planets. They blame God's punishment

13
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:49,600
for human sin. They try prayers, bloodletting, burning aromatic herbs.

14
00:00:49,600 --> 00:00:53,920
Flagellants walk between cities whipping themselves bloody to appease God. Nothing

15
00:00:53,920 --> 00:00:57,840
works because nobody understands that it is bacterial, carried by fleas,

16
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:00,960
living on rats, traveling on every trade route in Europe.

17
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:07,040
Step 4. In four years, 25 million dead. One third of Europe erased. Entire villages emptied.

18
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:11,600
Economies collapse. Feudalism crumbles. But from the devastation, change.

19
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:17,120
Labor becomes scarce. Scarce labor becomes valuable. Peasants demand rights. Wages rise.

20
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:21,520
The rigid medieval social order shatters. The renaissance emerges from the plague pit.

21
00:01:21,520 --> 00:01:25,040
The Black Death didn't just kill a third of Europe. It ended the Middle Ages.

22
